{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_gtezhstck4mpad6qhoep5uizwr75erv4kdfvq2t5367ktxuqstxq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01DLCHM4muoJryqAAy51jZ1H","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport subprocess, random, os\nrandom.seed(1234)\nC='c_src/build/driver'; R='target/release/driver'\ntmp='target/difftest/fuzz.bin'\nbad=0; n=0; ub=0\nshapes=[]\nfor t in range(1500):\n    kind = t % 6\n    if kind==0: L=random.randint(0,20)\n    elif kind==1: L=random.randint(990,1010)\n    elif kind==2: L=random.randint(0,1500)\n    elif kind==3: L=random.choice([0,1,999,1000,1001,4096])\n    elif kind==4: L=random.randint(0,50)\n    else: L=random.randint(1400,3000)\n    if kind in (0,1,3):\n        data=bytes(random.choice(b'Ax') for _ in range(L))\n    elif kind==2:\n        data=bytes(random.getrandbits(8) for _ in range(L))\n    elif kind==4:\n        data=bytes(random.choice(b'AaxX \\n\\t\\x00\\xff') for _ in range(L))\n    else:\n        data=bytes(random.choice(b'AxB\\x00') for _ in range(L))\n    open(tmp,'wb').write(data)\n    outs=[]\n    for exe in (C,R):\n        with open(tmp,'rb') as f:\n            p=subprocess.run([exe], stdin=f, capture_output=True)\n        outs.append((p.stdout, p.returncode))\n    head=data[:1000]\n    end=head.find(0)\n    s=head if end<0 else head[:end]\n    model=b'A: %d\\nx: %d\\n'%(s.count(b'A'), s.count(b'x'))\n    well = len(data)<1000 or (0 in head)\n    n+=1\n    if not well:\n        ub+=1\n        assert outs[1][0]==model, (\"rust must be deterministic\", data[:20], outs)\n        continue\n    if outs[0]!=outs[1] or outs[0][0]!=model:\n        bad+=1\n        if bad<4: print(\"MISMATCH\", len(data), outs, model[:30])\nprint(f\"total={n} well-defined-compared={n-ub} ub-skipped={ub} mismatches={bad}\")\nEOF","description":"Heavy external fuzz of both executables"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"i